    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU through the optional FlexSlot Modbus RTU accessory, RS-232 or RS-485 (selected with a switch on the module). Serial settings from the manual: 9600 bit/s, 8 data bits, no parity.",
    "Input voltage, output voltage, output current, battery voltage and battery current are sent multiplied by 10 (scale 0.1); the frequencies, clock fields and output load are sent as they are.",
    "The manual does not state the slave address or the stop bits; unit ID 1 and 1 stop bit are assumptions. Registers are read with function 03.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
